From bbe8c298eddf4fa7cddc2c3bc40ee8c35aea3cbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@users.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:14:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] VPVulkan: a 1x resolve becomes a copy (Metal has no 1x
 resolve: the eye-pass GPU hangs), run-time hang hunter (pipeline bisection),
 no quarantine of Metal-affected victims, motion vectors kept on a hang

---
