+  std::atomic<uint32_t> resolveRefused{0};  // 1x-resolves turned into plain stores (should stay 0)
   // Pipelines whose encoder hung the GPU: their draws/dispatches are skipped from then on (a lost
   // pass instead of a lost device). Persisted in <VP_PIPELINE_CACHE_DIR>/quarantine.txt so the next
   // launch starts with them; VP_QUARANTINE=0 turns it off. The submit thread copies the set only
